WEBVTT

00:07.080 --> 00:08.920
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:34.880 --> 01:38.920
ADAPTED FROM JIA JIN CHAI, ORIGINAL NOVEL
BY XIAOJIAREN ON JINJIANG LITERATURE CITY

01:42.640 --> 01:44.240
No… What are you doing?

01:45.160 --> 01:47.440
It was so many years ago.
Nothing worth seeing.

01:47.520 --> 01:49.000
Why do you insist?

01:49.840 --> 01:52.680
She used to work right here.

01:56.600 --> 01:57.960
Children, take a break if you're tired.

01:58.040 --> 01:58.960
Take it easy.

02:00.040 --> 02:03.720
If I hadn't taken pity on her,
who would've taken in a child?

02:03.800 --> 02:06.880
She could barely do any work
and wasted so much of my food.

02:06.960 --> 02:09.479
While she lived here,
she was well fed and warmly clothed.

02:09.560 --> 02:10.720
She had it good here.

02:10.800 --> 02:11.640
For our…

02:11.720 --> 02:12.880
Please, don't!

02:12.960 --> 02:15.640
Your Liu family is notorious
for being stingy.

02:15.720 --> 02:17.640
You hire half-grown children
to save on wages.

02:18.400 --> 02:19.640
Expect me to believe you?

02:19.720 --> 02:21.320
If you still won't tell the truth,

02:22.000 --> 02:25.760
when I get it out of someone else,
I'll sever the tendons in your hands.

02:26.280 --> 02:28.160
Please spare me. The truth is,

02:28.840 --> 02:30.680
she only worked here for a year.

02:31.360 --> 02:33.280
She usually slept right there.

02:39.600 --> 02:41.680
You mistreated an eight-year-old child.

02:42.200 --> 02:43.040
Are you even human?

02:43.120 --> 02:45.040
If I hadn't taken her in,

02:45.120 --> 02:46.000
that little bag of bones

02:46.080 --> 02:47.800
would've been buried
in some weed-choked grave!

02:48.400 --> 02:49.240
She should be thanking me!

02:50.200 --> 02:52.480
-If you don't believe me, I'll show you.
-Lead the way!

02:56.480 --> 02:57.600
Thank you, My lord…

03:01.800 --> 03:02.640
Thank you, my dear.

03:15.040 --> 03:16.760
My Lady, really.

03:16.840 --> 03:19.720
You could've had them inspect the cellar.
Why go down there yourself?

03:20.840 --> 03:22.280
Pitiable as the refugees are,

03:23.320 --> 03:24.880
yet many among them
who are lazy and shifty.

03:25.640 --> 03:28.160
This cellar will hold food
for the whole winter.

03:28.800 --> 03:30.000
-I have to inspect it myself.
-Coming.

03:33.200 --> 03:34.560
All this just to survive?

03:35.320 --> 03:36.560
Why push yourself this far?

03:38.120 --> 03:39.280
I've already promised you…

03:39.920 --> 03:41.920
I can't rely entirely
on you to protect me.

03:43.840 --> 03:45.760
You can't be by my side every moment.

03:45.840 --> 03:46.680
It's done.

03:46.760 --> 03:47.640
Besides,

03:48.800 --> 03:49.960
winters are bitterly cold.

03:51.600 --> 03:52.760
People freeze to death every year.

03:53.840 --> 03:55.080
You don't know what
it's like to starve and freeze.

03:55.720 --> 03:56.880
Careful. Take it slow.

03:56.960 --> 04:01.680
One extra wheat cake
could saved one more life.

04:10.200 --> 04:11.720
Don't think too highly of me.

04:12.240 --> 04:15.600
These people
are the foundation of my position.

04:17.519 --> 04:19.600
Come on. I'll take you up the mountain.

04:20.200 --> 04:22.320
General Qi's trap caught a wild boar.

04:27.080 --> 04:28.520
Slow down.

04:39.840 --> 04:41.720
Let's go. Up the mountain.

04:43.040 --> 04:43.960
Bandit.

04:44.560 --> 04:45.680
I am a bandit.

04:46.440 --> 04:47.560
You're the only one I'm after.

04:48.520 --> 04:49.440
Let's go!

04:51.120 --> 04:52.840
My Lady!

04:52.920 --> 04:54.400
XIANZHUANG

04:54.480 --> 04:57.640
To pay off a debt,
her gambling-addict father

04:58.160 --> 05:00.040
removed her from the lacquer workshop

05:00.640 --> 05:01.920
and gave her to that family.

05:02.000 --> 05:04.080
Their 15-year-old son had just died,

05:04.160 --> 05:06.920
and they wanted a young girl's body
to bury with him.

05:07.760 --> 05:11.200
How could anyone be so heartless
as to do something so cruel?

05:11.280 --> 05:12.120
What happened to her after?

05:19.760 --> 05:20.800
-Over there!
-No!

05:20.880 --> 05:23.040
-No! Don't kill me!
-Still trying to run?

05:23.760 --> 05:24.760
No!

05:29.800 --> 05:30.960
At such a young age,

05:31.520 --> 05:35.720
she endured the pain
without making a sound.

05:37.760 --> 05:40.200
She pretended to be dead
and fooled them all.

05:52.960 --> 05:55.640
People at the mill said
that even in the dead of winter,

05:56.560 --> 05:58.040
A-Chou wore only a thin shirt.

05:58.720 --> 06:02.360
Her hands and feet
were split open with bloody cracks.

06:02.920 --> 06:05.080
They'd heal, then split open again.

06:06.560 --> 06:07.800
She was the youngest,

06:07.880 --> 06:09.960
yet she worked from cockcrow
until deep into the night

06:10.040 --> 06:12.000
and was always paid the least

06:13.240 --> 06:16.920
because the owner knew
she had nowhere else to go.

06:18.440 --> 06:20.040
Everyone called her Little Mute.

06:20.560 --> 06:21.880
When she first came to the mill,

06:22.480 --> 06:23.800
she could barely speak.

06:25.080 --> 06:27.840
-Why couldn't she speak?
-She'd been frightened into silence.

06:27.920 --> 06:31.320
But after narrowly escaping death
and spending a year at the mill,

06:31.400 --> 06:33.080
her birth father,
Lai Gen, found her again.

06:34.040 --> 06:37.080
People told her to run,
but she still went back.

06:37.760 --> 06:40.640
Oh, why would she go back?

06:40.720 --> 06:43.840
She said her mother was bedridden.

06:44.480 --> 06:47.920
If she didn't go back to work,
her younger sister would be sold too.

06:52.320 --> 06:56.440
Your aunt really ought
to be here hearing this.

06:57.640 --> 07:02.000
You people
forced that poor girl into all this.

07:02.080 --> 07:04.080
You'll pay for what you've done.

07:07.120 --> 07:10.120
Is that all you found?
Was there anything else?

07:12.160 --> 07:14.560
It's been so many years.
There are countless leads to follow.

07:16.120 --> 07:17.040
But I've found some clues

07:17.120 --> 07:19.680
about those who lived
with her in the tenement.

07:21.280 --> 07:23.000
Hurry. You must hurry.

07:24.040 --> 07:26.280
Grandmother, pitiful as she may be,
she's still an outsider.

07:27.200 --> 07:30.440
Why are you so concerned
about A-Chou's background?

07:30.960 --> 07:34.720
I've already checked. Madam Qiao
kept working even while pregnant

07:35.400 --> 07:37.080
and washed clothes by the river every day.

07:37.800 --> 07:40.440
The neighbors watched the child
be born and grow up.

07:41.520 --> 07:43.360
Her household
registration and age both match.

07:43.440 --> 07:45.320
Grandmother,
what are you still suspicious of?

07:45.400 --> 07:47.160
I honestly don't know.

07:47.240 --> 07:49.840
I just can't shake this uneasiness.

07:51.000 --> 07:53.000
Keep investigating. Hurry and dig deeper.

07:53.080 --> 07:55.600
All right. I'll keep looking.

07:55.680 --> 07:56.560
Go.

08:03.600 --> 08:05.200
What do you need this for?

08:05.280 --> 08:08.520
Aunt Heng'e, don't ask questions.
Just give it to me.

08:09.160 --> 08:11.360
-Jundai…
-I'm not your Jundai!

08:11.440 --> 08:12.960
I'm Wei Rao.

08:13.960 --> 08:16.320
My father was a hero
who died on the battlefield.

08:17.080 --> 08:20.400
My mother is Lady Li,
His Majesty's most favored consort.

08:21.080 --> 08:23.640
I'm the noblest young lady in the capital!

08:36.919 --> 08:38.320
Don't worry, Aunt Heng'e.

08:40.559 --> 08:41.919
It's only a precaution.

08:56.840 --> 09:00.520
KITCHEN

09:04.600 --> 09:07.080
-Is that ginseng soup for Grandmother?
-Yes.

09:08.000 --> 09:09.040
I'll take it from here.

09:15.760 --> 09:17.880
You're not needed here. Leave.

09:18.480 --> 09:21.200
Household rules require special care
with the Dowager Lady's meals.

09:21.880 --> 09:23.680
I can't leave it unattended
even for a moment.

09:33.640 --> 09:35.840
Grandmother,
you haven't had much appetite lately

09:35.920 --> 09:37.280
and often complain of fatigue.

09:38.160 --> 09:40.320
This ginseng soup
should be taken before your meal

09:40.400 --> 09:41.560
for the best effect.

09:42.080 --> 09:44.840
If taken afterward,
its effect is greatly reduced.

09:54.560 --> 09:57.480
-Brother Jue?
-Huo Jue, what are you doing?

09:58.080 --> 09:59.960
The kitchen is smoky
from all the charcoal fires.

10:00.040 --> 10:01.360
You've always hated it
and never set foot there.

10:02.240 --> 10:05.680
Yet today, you personally
brewed Grandmother's ginseng soup.

10:05.760 --> 10:06.960
Why is that?

10:23.840 --> 10:26.000
What's wrong with doing something
for my grandmother?

10:27.240 --> 10:28.320
Grandmother,

10:28.400 --> 10:30.360
I won't stay here
and offend anyone further.

10:30.440 --> 10:32.320
-I'll take my leave.
-My child…

10:33.280 --> 10:34.160
Rao!

10:38.240 --> 10:39.080
Grandmother…

10:39.720 --> 10:41.640
She meant well.

10:41.720 --> 10:46.120
Seeing that I've barely been eating
and have been coughing up phlegm,

10:46.200 --> 10:49.480
she had the maids
brew a strong ginseng soup

10:49.560 --> 10:51.680
with bamboo sap and ginger juice added.

10:51.760 --> 10:55.120
She meant well.
Why are you so suspicious of her?

10:55.200 --> 10:56.560
Grandmother, I just…

10:56.640 --> 10:58.560
You've been investigating
A-Chou's background every day,

10:59.160 --> 11:00.600
and it's making you
grow suspicious, isn't it?

11:03.520 --> 11:06.040
Still, without any evidence,

11:07.280 --> 11:08.720
you shouldn't have shown your suspicions.

11:10.320 --> 11:11.400
It was my fault.

11:11.960 --> 11:13.080
I'll go apologize to her now.

11:18.160 --> 11:19.920
He's still young after all.

11:20.680 --> 11:22.040
He can't keep his composure.

11:34.400 --> 11:35.320
Young Master.

11:41.320 --> 11:43.360
Rao! Rao! What are you doing?

11:43.440 --> 11:44.880
Rao! Drop it!

11:44.960 --> 11:45.880
-Let go of me!
-Give it to me!

11:46.480 --> 11:47.920
-Give it! Drop it!
-Let go of me!

11:49.240 --> 11:50.960
Why do you still care what happens to me?

11:52.160 --> 11:53.760
Rao, I'm sorry.

11:53.840 --> 11:59.200
You went to investigate A-Chou's past,
to see how miserable and pitiful she was.

11:59.280 --> 12:00.480
You've clearly begun to waver!

12:01.240 --> 12:02.320
Right.

12:02.400 --> 12:04.520
She's the pitiful one
for stealing my place,

12:05.720 --> 12:08.840
while I'm the wicked one
though I've lost everything.

12:09.760 --> 12:13.280
-That's not true.
-Just because I'm unruly, bad-tempered,

12:13.960 --> 12:16.560
and not as sly and calculating as she is,

12:17.920 --> 12:21.240
everyone despises me and speaks ill of me.

12:21.320 --> 12:23.720
Even when I try to do
something for Grandmother,

12:23.800 --> 12:25.840
you question and suspect me.

12:26.440 --> 12:28.760
I love Grandmother more than anyone.

12:28.840 --> 12:30.520
How could I ever harm her?

12:32.440 --> 12:34.880
Everything I do is wrong.

12:35.400 --> 12:39.480
Then just let me die
so I never have to offend your eyes again!

12:40.000 --> 12:40.840
Rao,

12:41.360 --> 12:44.640
I lost my head for a moment.
I don't know what came over me.

12:45.400 --> 12:48.160
I don't even know why
I would have such suspicions.

12:49.240 --> 12:50.920
Ever since Governess Chang died,

12:52.480 --> 12:54.040
you may not have said anything,

12:55.160 --> 12:56.880
but you've been doubting me all along.

12:57.560 --> 13:01.200
She was a deceitful, vicious old woman.
How could you believe her?

13:02.040 --> 13:03.920
You suspected me of
poisoning Grandmother, didn't you?

13:05.600 --> 13:06.440
Yes.

13:07.840 --> 13:09.240
I did hide poison under my pillow,

13:10.280 --> 13:12.080
but it was meant for me.

13:12.600 --> 13:15.040
I'd rather end my own life

13:15.840 --> 13:18.640
than be despised by everyone I love!

13:18.720 --> 13:21.000
Rao!

13:21.080 --> 13:22.720
Stop it, Rao! Rao!

13:27.560 --> 13:30.440
Go get the physician! Hurry!

13:31.760 --> 13:32.720
Rao,

13:33.240 --> 13:35.600
forgive me. I was wrong.

13:36.680 --> 13:40.000
From now on, I'll believe whatever you say
and never doubt you without cause again.

13:42.760 --> 13:43.800
Rao!

13:46.680 --> 13:48.120
Someone!

13:48.640 --> 13:50.720
Come quickly!

13:50.800 --> 13:52.320
ZHAOYANG PALACE

14:09.400 --> 14:10.240
All of you, leave.

14:15.600 --> 14:17.680
You said Rao tried to take her own life?

14:17.760 --> 14:18.600
Don't panic, Your Ladyship.

14:18.680 --> 14:21.000
Fortunately, Lord Huo stopped her in time.

14:21.080 --> 14:22.040
She swallowed very little poison.

14:22.720 --> 14:24.400
She's been given a licorice
and bean decoction as an antidote.

14:24.480 --> 14:26.160
Her internal organs are unharmed.

14:40.120 --> 14:41.000
Please calm down, Your Ladyship.

14:41.920 --> 14:44.080
This is all my fault.

14:45.240 --> 14:47.440
Rao has suffered so much,

14:48.840 --> 14:50.800
yet I still told her to hide and wait.

14:52.560 --> 14:58.200
A noble daughter of a great family
forced to live in hiding…

14:59.880 --> 15:02.160
She must blame me, her own mother.

15:03.560 --> 15:05.120
Where's Madam Qiao?

15:05.200 --> 15:08.040
You've searched for so long.
Has she been found yet?

15:08.560 --> 15:09.520
Your Ladyship,

15:09.600 --> 15:12.680
we've searched every prefecture
and county around the capital.

15:13.200 --> 15:15.760
We've also checked the Imperial
Medical Bureau and local clinics.

15:15.840 --> 15:17.240
But we only got word this morning.

15:17.320 --> 15:18.440
Two years ago,

15:18.520 --> 15:20.960
the retired Imperial Physician
Wang Zhonglu

15:21.040 --> 15:23.400
was best known for
treating wasting illnesses.

15:24.960 --> 15:27.240
-Where is he now?
-Yong County.

15:28.000 --> 15:30.400
Turn all of Yong County
upside down if you must.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.880
Find Madam Qiao and her daughter.

15:32.720 --> 15:33.680
Yes.

15:42.080 --> 15:44.840
Take this and give it to Rao.

15:44.920 --> 15:48.560
Tell her
I've never forgotten what I promised her.

15:49.520 --> 15:51.520
Tell her to focus on recovering.

15:53.040 --> 15:54.760
Once she's well enough to get out of bed,

15:55.880 --> 15:59.600
I will have her back and make them pay.

16:01.920 --> 16:04.200
RADIANT BEAUTY, RARE GRACE

16:12.240 --> 16:14.400
A-Chou, oh A-Chou.

16:14.480 --> 16:18.280
You forced me to become like a stray dog,
wagging my tail and begging for mercy.

16:19.040 --> 16:21.160
Even if I descend to the underworld,

16:21.680 --> 16:23.720
I won't go alone.

16:25.000 --> 16:27.600
I'll drag you down with me.

16:32.080 --> 16:32.920
Missed.

16:33.640 --> 16:35.520
Archery takes time to master.

16:35.600 --> 16:36.640
Don't rush.

16:37.520 --> 16:38.360
Here.

16:52.480 --> 16:53.760
I spend days in the barracks.

16:54.360 --> 16:55.960
I'm rough by nature, lacking formalities.

16:57.600 --> 17:00.720
If I've overstepped any boundaries,
please forgive me, Your Ladyship.

17:01.240 --> 17:02.080
The army has been busy lately,

17:03.080 --> 17:04.960
so I may not be able
to come for some time.

17:05.040 --> 17:07.760
If you want to learn archery,
I know a woman archer.

17:07.839 --> 17:09.280
I'll have her teach you instead.
That would be more appropriate.

17:10.000 --> 17:12.040
Thank you, General.
I was thinking the same thing.

17:14.359 --> 17:15.680
Come see how the training is going.

17:16.400 --> 17:17.440
They're finally starting to shape up.

17:24.240 --> 17:25.359
-Are you all right?
-Unacceptable!

17:25.440 --> 17:27.319
Whose child behaves so poorly?

17:27.400 --> 17:29.200
The training ground
is no place to run around!

17:30.000 --> 17:31.880
Forgive us, Your Ladyship!

17:31.960 --> 17:33.480
That careless fool.

17:34.840 --> 17:35.880
Your Ladyship,

17:35.960 --> 17:38.400
her husband broke his leg
while hunting in the mountains.

17:38.480 --> 17:39.920
The family had no way to make a living,

17:40.000 --> 17:41.920
so we let her stay
and do laundry for the estate.

17:42.520 --> 17:44.000
Hurry and apologize!

17:44.080 --> 17:45.440
Forgive me, Your Ladyship.

17:45.520 --> 17:47.000
Blades have no eyes.

17:47.080 --> 17:49.120
Watch the child. Don't let him get hurt.

17:49.200 --> 17:50.240
Bitao.

17:52.200 --> 17:53.040
Try some.

18:05.360 --> 18:07.480
You're far too noble
for this, Your Ladyship.

18:07.560 --> 18:09.680
It's an honor for them.
Quick, kowtow to Her Ladyship!

18:10.280 --> 18:11.200
No need.

18:13.160 --> 18:14.280
These two children…

18:15.040 --> 18:16.160
Oh, they're twins.

18:17.000 --> 18:17.840
Quite an adorable pair.

18:19.280 --> 18:21.400
Don't be afraid.
It's a gift from Her Ladyship.

18:21.480 --> 18:22.520
Just accept it.

18:24.560 --> 18:26.280
Here, take them all.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.280
-Come on.
-Hurry. Let's go.

18:30.360 --> 18:32.040
Don't come running in here again.

18:33.080 --> 18:34.080
General Qi,

18:36.600 --> 18:39.160
in this world,
can two people really look so alike?

18:39.240 --> 18:42.800
Women carrying twins have often seen

18:42.880 --> 18:43.760
both mother and child lost.

18:44.760 --> 18:48.240
That's why twins are rare.
Rare, but not unheard of.

18:48.320 --> 18:49.520
Those two just now
were twins, weren't they?

18:49.600 --> 18:50.440
What if they aren't twins?

18:51.480 --> 18:53.200
If two people are
neither kin nor connected,

18:53.280 --> 18:54.720
yet happen to look alike,

18:55.240 --> 18:57.560
then it's fate playing tricks,
a coincidence.

18:58.440 --> 18:59.440
Fate?

19:02.040 --> 19:03.600
Could fate really
arrange such a coincidence?

19:06.040 --> 19:09.800
Two complete strangers
who aren't related by blood at all…

19:13.120 --> 19:14.240
How could they look so alike?

19:16.720 --> 19:17.800
Why?

19:20.760 --> 19:21.600
Your Ladyship,

19:21.680 --> 19:23.880
one of Lady Li's attendants
is heading toward Yong County.

19:32.160 --> 19:34.840
General Qi,
I need the men you've been training.

19:36.120 --> 19:37.480
They've only trained for a few days.

19:37.560 --> 19:39.360
They may look orderly,
but they're full of weaknesses.

19:40.120 --> 19:41.760
Against a well-trained army,

19:41.840 --> 19:44.640
they'd be swept aside,
unable to even put up a fight.

19:44.720 --> 19:47.400
If you need a hand,
I'll assign you some others.

19:47.480 --> 19:49.520
No. I can't use your men

19:50.400 --> 19:51.640
or the Lu family's.

19:53.160 --> 19:56.120
Besides, one can only learn
to farm by getting into the field.

19:58.040 --> 19:59.680
What good is training in a drill yard?

20:00.760 --> 20:02.040
They need real experience.

20:12.080 --> 20:13.200
Mother!

20:18.840 --> 20:20.520
Please! Spare me!

20:20.600 --> 20:21.920
I… I've paid off all my gambling debts.

20:22.000 --> 20:23.480
-I don't owe a single coin!
-No.

20:23.560 --> 20:25.200
-Don't take me.
-General, what's going on?

20:27.480 --> 20:28.800
Mother. Hongxian.

20:28.880 --> 20:31.960
You good-for-nothing.
All you do is drink and gamble.

20:32.040 --> 20:33.000
Now look, you've brought them right to us!

20:33.600 --> 20:35.720
-Take them all away!
-I'm innocent!

20:35.800 --> 20:37.400
I'm innocent!

20:37.480 --> 20:39.120
I'm innocent!

20:45.160 --> 20:46.120
Who are you people?

20:46.200 --> 20:48.400
-Why are you taking us?
-Keep quiet.

20:48.920 --> 20:50.640
Settle down and stop causing trouble.

20:55.480 --> 20:58.120
Deputy General Zhao,
my stomach's acting up. I need to go!

20:58.800 --> 21:00.720
-Me too.
-I can't hold it either!

21:00.800 --> 21:01.560
-What's going on?
-Move!

21:01.640 --> 21:02.720
Pull yourselves together!

21:02.800 --> 21:04.040
It must've been that tea stall we passed.

21:04.120 --> 21:06.360
Someone must've tampered with the tea.

21:06.440 --> 21:07.640
What?

21:10.320 --> 21:11.160
‎Go there.

21:19.400 --> 21:21.880
Someone's attacking the carriage!
Guards! Guards!

21:28.640 --> 21:29.680
‎Don't try anything!

21:32.160 --> 21:32.960
We've got them all.

21:36.880 --> 21:38.440
-Don't kill me!
-Don't kill me! Please!

21:38.520 --> 21:39.360
-Don't kill me!
-Mother. Hongxian.

21:41.640 --> 21:44.880
A-Chou? Mother, A-Chou came to save us!

21:44.960 --> 21:46.920
Your Ladyship, I drugged them all.

21:47.000 --> 21:48.440
-Didn't I do a fine job?
-Get down!

21:48.520 --> 21:49.800
You get the greatest credit.

21:51.080 --> 21:53.120
For this victory,
every man under my command

21:53.640 --> 21:56.000
gets 100 coins and a bolt of silk.

21:56.080 --> 21:56.920
From now on,

21:57.000 --> 21:58.920
a dou of fine rice and a plate
of meat will be added to every meal!

21:59.720 --> 22:01.400
Your Ladyship prevails!

22:01.480 --> 22:02.960
Your Ladyship prevails!

22:03.040 --> 22:04.920
Your Ladyship prevails!

22:05.000 --> 22:06.240
Your Ladyship prevails!

22:09.480 --> 22:11.680
Physician Wang truly works wonders.

22:11.760 --> 22:13.160
You look so much better, Mother.

22:13.800 --> 22:14.800
A-Chou,

22:15.360 --> 22:17.720
looking at you now,
I can barely recognize you.

22:23.080 --> 22:24.160
There's so much good food here.

22:24.760 --> 22:26.600
How could the two of us finish it all?

22:26.680 --> 22:28.080
Why not call your brother and sister over

22:29.240 --> 22:30.960
so the whole family can be together?

22:31.040 --> 22:33.800
They've been frightened half
to death and are covered in dirt.

22:33.880 --> 22:35.040
They're in quite a state.

22:35.560 --> 22:37.280
I had someone take them to wash up.

22:38.280 --> 22:39.280
Food will be prepared for them.

22:39.880 --> 22:42.840
Your brother loves drinking.
Someone needs to keep an eye on him.

22:43.720 --> 22:46.400
And Hongxian was scared out of her wits.
I'd better go check on them.

22:46.480 --> 22:49.560
We haven't seen each other in so long,
yet you haven't even said you missed me.

22:49.640 --> 22:51.760
All you talk about
is Hongxian and Runsheng.

22:51.840 --> 22:52.800
You're playing favorites.

22:53.400 --> 22:55.440
Are those two
the only ones you care about?

22:55.520 --> 22:56.640
What about me, your daughter?

22:59.560 --> 23:01.160
I think about you every day.

23:02.120 --> 23:05.200
But of my three children,
you're the oldest.

23:05.880 --> 23:09.400
You're smart and sensible,
so I worry about you the least.

23:09.480 --> 23:10.680
Those two are different.

23:10.760 --> 23:12.040
The moment I take my eyes
off them, there's trouble.

23:12.120 --> 23:14.640
There are so many people
around this estate.

23:15.160 --> 23:18.880
I'm just afraid…
afraid they'll cause trouble for you.

23:23.200 --> 23:24.040
Is that so?

23:28.640 --> 23:29.680
My daughter,

23:30.440 --> 23:31.680
it's been a while.

23:31.760 --> 23:33.800
You've changed so much.

23:35.320 --> 23:36.440
How have I changed?

23:37.040 --> 23:38.360
I can't quite put it into words.

23:39.080 --> 23:41.920
You've become more imposing
and more formidable.

23:42.840 --> 23:46.120
And the way you speak
and act is nothing like before.

23:46.200 --> 23:47.600
I'm just a poor old woman.

23:48.280 --> 23:50.160
Even I feel
a little intimidated by you now.

23:51.200 --> 23:52.480
I can hardly recognize you.

23:53.720 --> 23:57.280
No matter how much I change,
I'll always be your daughter.

24:03.800 --> 24:04.840
This…

24:05.480 --> 24:07.120
Is someone else joining us?

24:09.720 --> 24:12.080
An old acquaintance
wants to catch up with you.

24:14.360 --> 24:15.520
The Grand Military Review
takes place once every three years.

24:15.600 --> 24:17.720
Every unit is doing all it can to
distinguish itself before His Majesty.

24:17.800 --> 24:19.040
You have trainings
first thing tomorrow morning.

24:19.120 --> 24:21.960
You said you'd stay at the barracks,
yet you came rushing back again.

24:23.440 --> 24:25.400
Are you afraid
Her Ladyship might run away?

24:27.360 --> 24:29.240
I spoke out of turn. I deserve this.

24:29.840 --> 24:30.800
Who is that woman?

24:39.320 --> 24:42.000
Go find out
who Her Ladyship invited tonight.

24:42.720 --> 24:43.600
Yes.

24:55.480 --> 24:57.800
It's been a long time.
I hope you've been well.

24:57.880 --> 25:00.280
I pay my respects to Your Ladyship.

25:02.440 --> 25:03.480
Oh my.

25:04.040 --> 25:06.360
How could I let
Your Ladyship serve me wine?

25:07.640 --> 25:09.520
This is too much of an honor for me.

25:10.680 --> 25:11.920
How could I forget my roots?

25:12.560 --> 25:14.600
When Han Liao
deliberately stirred up trouble,

25:15.120 --> 25:17.240
if you hadn't acted so cleverly
to help me, Governess Liu,

25:17.320 --> 25:18.400
how could I have everything today?

25:19.200 --> 25:21.360
Afterward, to stay out of trouble,

25:21.960 --> 25:24.520
you had to keep hiding
from place to place.

25:24.600 --> 25:26.200
I've always felt guilty about that.

25:27.280 --> 25:29.240
I should have toasted you long ago.

25:30.800 --> 25:31.720
Here's to you, Governess Liu.

25:36.280 --> 25:38.640
Even a crafty rabbit
has three burrows, doesn't it?

25:38.720 --> 25:41.440
With all the money you gave me,
changing my hideout from time to time

25:41.520 --> 25:42.640
is no big deal.

25:42.720 --> 25:46.080
If you hadn't invite me here,
I wouldn't have shown my face.

25:46.960 --> 25:49.600
I knew from the start
you were destined for greater things.

25:50.360 --> 25:52.800
So all my efforts to cover for you
weren't wasted.

25:53.840 --> 25:55.280
You know how to repay a kindness.

25:55.960 --> 25:57.360
Come on. Let's drink one more bowl!

26:02.280 --> 26:06.280
Wei Rao, what exactly are you planning?

26:06.880 --> 26:07.720
Let me toast you again.

26:10.080 --> 26:11.200
Here.

26:18.680 --> 26:22.800
Just look at you,
so dignified and elegant.

26:23.960 --> 26:26.640
Madam Qiao, with a daughter like this,

26:26.720 --> 26:28.640
you'll enjoy a life of comfort!

26:29.800 --> 26:31.800
Too much to drink
and you start talking nonsense.

26:31.880 --> 26:33.840
What if someone overhears you?

26:33.920 --> 26:35.200
Why not take her to bed?

26:35.280 --> 26:37.160
A generous gift tomorrow to thank her.

26:39.240 --> 26:41.800
There's no rush.
There are no outsiders here.

26:43.040 --> 26:45.600
What's the harm
in talking a little longer?

26:47.600 --> 26:50.840
When I was little,
my father often beat and berated me.

26:51.360 --> 26:53.200
I thought I wouldn't live past eight.

26:54.360 --> 26:55.600
Who'd have thought it'd come to this?

26:56.840 --> 27:01.240
It just shows that no one
can predict what life has in store.

27:04.040 --> 27:05.560
Exactly.

27:05.640 --> 27:08.600
That heartless father of yours
abandoned you in the mountains,

27:08.680 --> 27:10.880
thinking the wolves would carry you off.

27:11.640 --> 27:15.280
"Survive a great calamity,
and better days will come."

27:15.360 --> 27:17.160
That saying came true for you.

27:20.120 --> 27:21.240
That really happened?

27:22.000 --> 27:22.840
How come I never knew?

27:22.920 --> 27:25.680
You were only two then.

27:26.200 --> 27:27.160
How could you remember?

27:28.000 --> 27:30.960
That scoundrel lost money gambling

27:31.800 --> 27:32.840
and blamed you for bringing him bad luck.

27:33.600 --> 27:37.520
When I wasn't looking, he secretly
carried you away and abandoned you.

27:39.400 --> 27:41.280
My Lord, keep it down.

27:41.360 --> 27:44.040
That night, your mother
came back from washing clothes.

27:44.120 --> 27:47.120
When she couldn't find you,
she went frantic.

27:47.200 --> 27:50.040
She wouldn't listen to any of us

27:50.120 --> 27:53.400
and ran into
the mountains alone to look for you.

27:54.120 --> 27:56.480
A-Chou! A-Chou!

27:59.360 --> 28:00.440
A-Chou!

28:01.720 --> 28:02.760
A-Chou!

28:06.080 --> 28:06.840
A-Chou!

28:07.520 --> 28:08.920
Go away!

28:10.640 --> 28:11.880
A-Chou…

28:24.200 --> 28:25.800
In this whole world,

28:26.320 --> 28:32.280
only a mother
would dare fight wolves for her child.

28:32.360 --> 28:35.120
When your mother
came down the mountain the next day,

28:35.200 --> 28:39.080
her whole body was covered in wounds.

28:39.600 --> 28:43.360
A wolf even tore
a chunk of flesh from here.

28:43.440 --> 28:47.160
But she held you tight
and wouldn't let go.

28:47.240 --> 28:51.360
No one could separate the two of you.

28:51.440 --> 28:56.080
I'll never forget this moment
for the rest of my life.

29:14.200 --> 29:15.800
So these scars on your arm

29:17.600 --> 29:19.120
were all because of me.

29:20.400 --> 29:23.920
I thought you didn't care about me,
that you didn't love me.

29:24.520 --> 29:26.200
You did all that for me.

29:27.600 --> 29:29.320
Why did you never tell me?

29:33.680 --> 29:35.560
I was weak and couldn't protect you.

29:36.280 --> 29:38.320
It was all my fault.

29:40.120 --> 29:41.800
I failed you.

29:45.080 --> 29:46.560
I'm sorry, my child.

29:47.760 --> 29:50.080
I made you suffer so much

29:50.880 --> 29:53.000
and shouldered
the burden of this whole family.

29:53.640 --> 29:55.960
Even now, we're still dragging you down.

29:57.480 --> 29:59.800
It breaks my heart.

30:06.000 --> 30:10.400
Why did you never tell me
how much you were suffering inside?

30:13.160 --> 30:14.680
I never wanted much.

30:15.920 --> 30:18.000
What you've given me
has always been enough.

30:21.200 --> 30:22.440
Governess Liu is drunk.

30:23.200 --> 30:25.240
Let me take you back to rest.

30:25.320 --> 30:28.280
You two have a good talk.

30:28.840 --> 30:29.760
What fine wine!

30:30.280 --> 30:33.040
A wolf tore a chunk of flesh right off…

30:36.680 --> 30:37.520
Mother,

30:38.720 --> 30:40.400
Hongxian said she missed me.

30:40.920 --> 30:43.280
I've settled her in the west wing room.

30:44.480 --> 30:45.720
Why don't you move there too?

30:46.400 --> 30:48.280
I've been traveling for days. I'm tired.

30:49.120 --> 30:50.440
I don't want to keep moving around.

30:51.480 --> 30:52.960
This room is perfectly fine.

30:54.040 --> 30:56.320
You sisters should
spend some time together.

30:57.520 --> 30:58.960
-Okay?
-Sure.

31:02.760 --> 31:04.200
Whatever you say, Mother.

31:39.360 --> 31:40.440
You're back, my dear?

31:42.280 --> 31:43.320
Why are your eyes red?

31:45.880 --> 31:47.280
Have you had dinner yet?

31:47.800 --> 31:48.760
I'll have someone prepare it.

31:50.600 --> 31:53.240
Don't bother. His Majesty will inspect
the troops during the winter hunt.

31:55.720 --> 31:58.600
There's still much to do at the barracks.
I'll pack a few things and leave.

31:59.960 --> 32:01.600
Then I'll pack for you.

32:07.440 --> 32:09.520
Here. Put this on. It's cold at night.

32:14.760 --> 32:17.800
I'm leaving Zhao Song and Zhao Bai here.
If you need anything, just tell them.

32:19.840 --> 32:20.920
Okay, I know.

32:22.560 --> 32:23.440
Good night.

32:33.800 --> 32:35.400
From what she said in there just now,

32:36.240 --> 32:38.640
she seems to doubt about her own origins.

32:41.080 --> 32:42.080
My… My Lord,

32:42.160 --> 32:45.080
weren't you staying here tonight?
Why did you suddenly change your mind?

32:45.160 --> 32:46.160
THE FRAGRANT ORCHID

32:46.240 --> 32:47.560
Go find someone
from the Wei family for me.

32:47.640 --> 32:49.000
Who are you looking for at
the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence?

32:50.480 --> 32:52.280
No. Not the Earl of Cheng'an's Residence.

32:52.880 --> 32:55.440
Go to the Court of Justice.
I'll go there myself.

32:57.200 --> 33:00.120
My Lord! What are you going to
the Court of Justice for, My Lord?

33:02.960 --> 33:04.120
I was such a fool.

33:06.320 --> 33:08.480
How could I doubt my own mother?

33:13.160 --> 33:14.600
If she weren't my birth mother,

33:16.920 --> 33:19.240
why would she fight wolves
to save my life?

33:22.200 --> 33:23.360
I was so foolish.

33:24.960 --> 33:26.120
Your Ladyship,

33:26.640 --> 33:29.800
the silkworm house is ready.
You can inspect it when you have time.

33:30.440 --> 33:33.360
You said the soldiers
should be divided into three ranks,

33:33.440 --> 33:36.400
with different pay and meals for each.

33:36.920 --> 33:38.720
Mr. Feng has drafted the regulations.

33:38.800 --> 33:40.960
Once you've reviewed them,
we'll post them.

33:41.040 --> 33:42.680
The fruit tree saplings have arrived too.

33:42.760 --> 33:44.120
It's getting late.

33:45.360 --> 33:47.120
There's plenty to do tomorrow.

33:48.320 --> 33:49.680
You should get some sleep.

33:50.800 --> 33:53.280
Yes, it's late.

33:58.240 --> 33:59.480
Time to rest.

34:09.000 --> 34:10.760
Oh, no! Fire!

34:10.840 --> 34:12.320
-Fire!
-Fire!

34:12.400 --> 34:14.120
-Put it out!
-Oh, no!

34:14.199 --> 34:17.400
-Put out the fire!
-Hurry!

34:17.480 --> 34:18.400
Help!

34:18.480 --> 34:20.040
Hurry!

34:20.120 --> 34:22.080
Save Her Ladyship! Hurry!

34:23.199 --> 34:24.159
Help!

34:24.800 --> 34:26.159
Her Ladyship is still inside!

34:26.239 --> 34:28.280
-Her Ladyship's room is on fire!
-Help!

34:28.360 --> 34:29.800
-Someone, help!
-Hongxian!

34:29.880 --> 34:30.880
Put out the fire!

34:30.960 --> 34:33.199
-Hongxian!
-Her Ladyship is still inside!

34:34.159 --> 34:35.159
Fire!

34:36.080 --> 34:38.480
-Fire!
-Fire!

34:38.560 --> 34:40.360
Get more water!

34:40.440 --> 34:42.480
-Hurry!
-Help!

34:42.560 --> 34:43.760
-Hongxian!
-Help!

34:44.280 --> 34:46.120
-Hongxian!
-Hurry!

34:46.199 --> 34:48.040
-Hongxian!
-Water's here!

34:48.639 --> 34:49.920
Bring the water!

34:51.120 --> 34:51.960
Hongxian!

34:52.040 --> 34:53.320
-Get them out!
-Hurry!

34:53.960 --> 34:55.320
-Hurry!
-Hongxian!

34:56.360 --> 34:58.840
-Hurry!
-Get them out!

34:59.400 --> 35:00.760
-Someone, help!
-Water's here!

35:00.840 --> 35:02.520
Get them out!

35:03.120 --> 35:03.960
Fire!

35:05.400 --> 35:07.360
Fire over here!

35:07.880 --> 35:08.920
Get more water!

35:09.520 --> 35:11.560
-Hurry!
-Get more water!

35:14.160 --> 35:15.520
Hurry!

35:28.080 --> 35:29.920
Have you forgotten…

35:31.920 --> 35:33.640
that you have another daughter?

35:47.120 --> 35:48.760
I'm not your daughter.

35:51.360 --> 35:52.720
Then who am I?

35:56.960 --> 35:58.760
Who am I?

36:08.720 --> 36:10.200
That foolish maid

36:10.280 --> 36:12.280
knocked over a candlestick on night watch.

36:12.360 --> 36:14.360
Luckily, you woke up in time,
so it didn't turn into a disaster.

36:15.240 --> 36:16.720
They were all running around in a panic.

36:16.800 --> 36:17.840
How could anyone
put out the fire like that?

36:17.920 --> 36:19.680
They were only getting in the way.

36:20.520 --> 36:22.960
You got to sort them out.
Don't let it slide.

36:23.560 --> 36:24.480
Stop bothering your sister.

36:25.320 --> 36:26.160
She's busy.

36:26.960 --> 36:27.920
Mother,

36:28.000 --> 36:30.360
A-Chou said now that we're in the capital,
we don't need to leave again.

36:31.000 --> 36:33.000
We'll live here from now on.

36:33.080 --> 36:36.400
She also said she'd find me a good teacher
to teach me music and dance.

36:37.280 --> 36:39.120
We'll never have to
hide from place to place

36:39.200 --> 36:40.120
or live in fear again.

36:40.840 --> 36:44.240
I've always wanted to learn to dance,
but I could never afford the tuition.

36:45.120 --> 36:46.200
-Now A-Chou can…
-Enough!

36:47.560 --> 36:48.400
Stop talking.

36:53.040 --> 36:55.320
Mother's tired.
You should get some rest too.

37:11.840 --> 37:12.760
A-Chou,

37:14.560 --> 37:16.320
I hope you won't be so cruel

37:17.160 --> 37:21.080
as to take revenge on us
once you learn the truth about your birth.

37:21.840 --> 37:23.840
I was the only one at fault.

37:23.920 --> 37:25.600
Nothing to do with Hongxian and Runsheng.

37:25.680 --> 37:26.880
Please spare them, all right?

37:32.000 --> 37:33.280
I'm heartless?

37:37.480 --> 37:39.200
Because you had tuberculosis,

37:40.200 --> 37:43.760
I became an apprentice
at a lacquer workshop when I was only six.

37:45.200 --> 37:47.760
Then Father sold me into a ghost marriage.

37:48.880 --> 37:52.560
I barely escaped with my life,
but I still came back.

37:53.520 --> 37:54.720
I was afraid.

37:56.040 --> 37:57.880
I was afraid that if I escaped alone,

37:59.840 --> 38:01.280
you would be beaten,

38:02.240 --> 38:03.520
and my siblings would be sold.

38:04.480 --> 38:06.280
I worked myself to the bone.

38:08.520 --> 38:11.480
I'd rather gnaw on tree bark
or cut flesh from my own body…

38:13.760 --> 38:15.440
than ever let any of you go hungry.

38:16.960 --> 38:18.320
But what did you do, Mother?

38:18.400 --> 38:20.920
You watched me get beaten and sold.

38:21.440 --> 38:24.560
I was treated like an animal,
suffering day and night,

38:24.640 --> 38:27.760
yet you never told me
a single word of the truth.

38:33.680 --> 38:35.320
You just told me to accept my fate…

38:38.040 --> 38:41.600
that I was born into poverty
and destined for a life of suffering.

38:42.680 --> 38:44.000
You told me to endure it,

38:44.080 --> 38:46.560
persuade me into
sacrificing myself for your own children.

38:46.640 --> 38:48.080
And now…

38:51.480 --> 38:53.960
you're calling me heartless?

38:59.240 --> 39:01.760
A-Chou, I shouldn't have said that.

39:01.840 --> 39:04.040
I was wrong. Please forgive me.

39:05.000 --> 39:07.280
If you feel even the slightest guilt,

39:08.720 --> 39:10.520
tell me the truth.

39:22.840 --> 39:23.880
That night,

39:24.840 --> 39:26.560
I did drive the wolves away…

39:28.560 --> 39:32.560
but my child had already frozen to death.

39:33.640 --> 39:36.200
I buried her on the mountain.

40:06.120 --> 40:07.920
My A-Chou, I…

40:12.640 --> 40:13.480
A-Chou.

40:15.040 --> 40:16.080
A-Chou. A-Chou.

40:17.000 --> 40:18.960
Don't cry. Don't cry.

40:19.040 --> 40:21.080
Then I found you.

40:44.760 --> 40:46.880
I took off my coat
and wrapped you in them…

40:48.960 --> 40:51.440
then slipped home with you
in the dead of night.

40:53.520 --> 40:55.200
How did no one notice?

40:56.040 --> 41:00.080
To a poor family, a two-year-old child
is no more noticed than a cat or dog.

41:01.520 --> 41:06.120
Even their own father wouldn't look twice,
let alone outsiders.

41:07.560 --> 41:11.800
I said you were my own daughter,
and no one ever questioned it.

41:14.440 --> 41:18.160
Then where are the clothes I was wearing
and the keepsakes that came with me?

41:27.200 --> 41:28.280
Bitao,

41:29.800 --> 41:31.560
Runsheng was dead drunk.

41:32.200 --> 41:34.120
He didn't even wake up
when the fire broke out.

41:35.680 --> 41:37.120
Go see if he's awake yet.

41:37.200 --> 41:38.200
Yes.

41:38.280 --> 41:40.160
No, please don't!

41:42.440 --> 41:43.480
I'll tell you.

41:44.120 --> 41:45.880
They're hidden under
the stove at our old home.

41:48.000 --> 41:50.920
A-Chou, I did lie to you,

41:51.000 --> 41:52.480
but if I hadn't took you
off that mountain,

41:52.560 --> 41:53.880
you would've frozen to death.

41:55.640 --> 41:57.800
For the sake of my saving you,

41:58.320 --> 42:00.360
please spare your brother and sister.

42:01.000 --> 42:03.200
Blame me if you must. Hate me if you must.

42:03.280 --> 42:04.680
Take it all out on me.

42:04.760 --> 42:06.240
They know nothing about this.

42:06.840 --> 42:10.160
Please spare them. I'm begging you.

42:14.080 --> 42:14.920
A-Chou,

42:16.360 --> 42:19.280
that night, I lost my daughter,

42:20.280 --> 42:22.720
and your parents
abandoned you on the mountain.

42:23.560 --> 42:25.360
They were the ones who cast you aside.

42:26.040 --> 42:28.960
You were fated to become my daughter.

42:29.560 --> 42:32.200
Yes, I was selfish back then.

42:32.280 --> 42:33.840
I made you suffer

42:33.920 --> 42:37.040
through endless hardship.
I know I was wrong.

42:37.560 --> 42:39.520
From now on, we can all stay together.

42:40.040 --> 42:41.800
I'll make it up to you
a thousand times over.

42:41.880 --> 42:42.960
All right?

42:48.640 --> 42:49.640
Mother…

42:51.920 --> 42:55.480
for more than a decade,
I've been repaying you for saving my life.

42:56.640 --> 42:58.200
Was that still not enough?

43:05.040 --> 43:07.840
A-Chou!

43:10.120 --> 43:12.400
I was never your A-Chou!

43:30.920 --> 43:33.440
My Lord, Her Ladyship sent everyone away.

43:33.520 --> 43:36.160
She's been in there alone for an hour.

43:38.400 --> 43:39.240
Break the door down.

43:40.800 --> 43:42.080
But…

43:42.680 --> 43:43.680
Open it.

43:44.280 --> 43:45.120
Yes.

44:20.920 --> 44:22.280
Why are you still hesitating?

44:26.120 --> 44:28.800
I already know everything I need to know.

44:30.320 --> 44:33.360
Since you've made up your mind,
you should see it through.

44:36.000 --> 44:39.760
You need to be more decisive.

46:31.920 --> 46:34.280
LONG LIFE, ENDLESS BLESSINGS

46:35.440 --> 46:36.440
There's someone…

46:38.960 --> 46:40.120
I'd like you to meet.

49:02.600 --> 49:05.000
‎NO ANIMALS WERE HARMED
‎IN THE MAKING OF THIS SHOW
